OL,3,AMahmood expected to announce changes to
OL,4,Arules around indefinite leave to remain
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood is
OL,7,Fexpected to announce her final decision
OL,8,Fon immigration rules for legal migrants
OL,9,Fnext week.
OL,11,FShe had proposed to extend the wait for
OL,12,Fpermanent settlement from the current
OL,13,Ffive years to 10 with some lower-paid
OL,14,Fmigrants facing a 15-year wait. The BBC
OL,15,Funderstands the proposals are likely to
OL,16,Fbe revised for most of those currently
OL,17,Fworking in social care.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
