OL,3,APolice deployed during stand-off over
OL,4,Acontrol of top Poland court
OL,5,
OL,6,FRiot police have been deployed at
OL,7,FPoland's Constitutional Court amid an
OL,8,Fescalating stand-off between the
OL,9,Fgovernment and the court's top judges.
OL,11,FThe row pits the government of Prime
OL,12,FMinister Donald Tusk against his
OL,13,Fpredecessors from the right-wing Law
OL,14,Fand Justice (PiS).
OL,16,FThe police intervention came after
OL,17,FJustice Minister Waldemar E;urek said
OL,18,Fhe had requested stripping the court's
OL,19,FPresident Bogdan EZwiDYczkowski and
OL,20,FVice-President BartEBomiej SochaEDski
OL,21,Fof their immunity from prosecution to
OL,22,Fbring criminal charges against them.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
